// CHECK-NEXT: | pop | mpsc | many | 1 | wait_free | 102400·np² + 49·n² + 960·np + 70·n + 78 + 68 slip pauses | - | may | none | per-thread record | move constructor, destructor | frees the segments it moves past, and may allocate to note the cells it passes that a push has taken and not filled, and allocates the shared_ptr it returns |
// CHECK-NEXT: | pop | spmc | 1 | 1 | wait_free | 49·n² + 70·n + 23 | - | may | none | per-thread record | move constructor, destructor | frees the segments it moves past, and allocates the shared_ptr it returns |
// CHECK-NEXT: | pop | spmc | 1 | many | lock_free | - | - | may | none | per-thread record | move constructor, destructor | frees the segments it moves past, and allocates the shared_ptr it returns |
// CHECK-NEXT: | pop | jiffy | 1 | 1 | wait_free | not bounded in the counts (a retire's scan walks the segments retired since the oldest mark a push holds, up to the queue's backlog when that push took its index) | 102400·np² + 49·n² + 960·np + 70·n + 78 + 68 slip pauses | may | none | per-thread record | move constructor, destructor | frees the segments it moves past, and may allocate to note the cells it passes that a push has taken and not filled, and allocates the shared_ptr it returns |
